{"ID":"20240118151206-mg7qtwh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151206-mg7qtwh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151206-mg7qtwh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151206-8c17zec\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122115634-802uqn8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122115634-802uqn8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:211,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:211\u0026#125;","title":"146水银","type":"doc","updated":"20240131093250"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151206-8c17zec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151206-8c17zec","updated":"20240131093218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛寒，主疥瘘痂伤白秃，杀皮肤中虱，堕胎，除热，杀金银铜锡毒，镕化还复为丹，久服神仙不死。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115609-r3zc90n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115609-r3zc90n"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产山西陕西山中。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115610-bfcvqei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115610-bfcvqei"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115611-y7p732d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115611-y7p732d"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】水银为杀虫要药，主治杨梅疮毒，及皮肤诸病，润肠下死胎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115612-abwj01a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115612-abwj01a"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】以傅男子阴，阴消无气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115614-nku1tth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115614-nku1tth"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】利水道，去热毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115615-5mq0r3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115615-5mq0r3r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】主天行热疾，除风，安神，镇心，治恶疮疥，杀虫，催生下死胎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115617-t1czyzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115617-t1czyzo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【宗奭】治小儿惊痫热潮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115618-3egjgkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115618-3egjgkb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】除湿热，解疮毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115619-tnil20p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115619-tnil20p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通多配合丸散方用，内服约数分，外用无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115621-so8mz9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115621-so8mz9v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】水银性沉，与金银诸物同，吞服金银水银者，皆足以致命，饵服者须慎之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115608-ob00k1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115608-ob00k1g"}},{"ID":"20240122115622-175lbku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115622-175lbku"}},{"ID":"20240122115623-usqzdrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115623-usqzdrv","updated":"20240131093131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一百四十六，我们有水银，你看[中经]的时候，药力很强，有毒，都(是)有毒性的药，这里水银也是，讲的也一般是外用。专门呢有内服的时候，有服，过去我们有服用水银的一些技巧，但是这种很毒的东西我们就不要太接近它，我们使用到硫磺就够了。那这个呢如果说你要杀金银铜铁铜锡，身体里面中的毒嘛，中的铜毒或是怎么样，我们使用硫磺来解，而不需要说用到水银来解。这个是杀虫的要药，我们杀虫的时候我们可以用雄黄、雌黄嘛，还有杨梅疮，就是性病那方面的东西。水银的性是非常的寒，你如果说把那个水银做成水银蛋，把那个男人的阴茎包在一起，那就永远不举了。一定要会，这样子你才不会弄错嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240122115630-4xcuju5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115630-4xcuju5","updated":"20240131093156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有内服，过去有内服，那是几分，一点点，因为水银的性很沉，它往下沉的力量非常的强，根本是金属类的东西嘛。所以，要服用的时候考虑哦，肚子里面杀一个虫，或者堕个胎，下胎，水银可以堕胎啊，肚子里面有蛔虫，我们中了一些那个金银铜铁那些方面的毒，我们有很多方法解，水银不需要用的，水银那么强，所以我几乎没有用过它。"}]},{"ID":"20240122115634-802uqn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115634-802uqn8","updated":"20240131093250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个杨梅疮，我们的那个性病的，我们有性病治疗的方法，很好，包括那个阴道，我们的那个阳具溃烂掉，睾丸肿，烂掉，都是性病嘛，中药都有的治，只是很多人家不好意思跟我讲而已嘛，那怎么办。诸位看到前阵子，广告，那个新闻上，你看我不是写给你们，在我的时事评论里面，现在的淋病，盘尼西林都没有用了，以前打上还有用，现在打都没有用了，为什么，抗拒性来了，好了，怎么办呢，那更强的盘尼西林嘛，这些更强的你试试看看，还是要找我们。我就不讲，教你们就好了。"}]}]}